# Design Decisions

## Why remove NavigationBarItem?

Reasons:

* No long press support.
* Internal gesture handling.
* Hard to customize.
* Future badges difficult.

Custom implementation gives full control.

---

## Why NavigationCoordinator?

Avoid:

```
BottomBar

↓

NavController
```

Preferred:

```
BottomBar

↓

NavigationCoordinator

↓

NavController
```

Single navigation entry point.

---

## Why WorkspaceManager?

Avoid UI storing current workspace.

Workspace state belongs to application layer.

Future persistence becomes trivial.

